{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2023-01-10 14:59:00', 'title': 'AS CLOUD MIGRATIONS SOAR, REALIZING THE FULL VALUE OF CLOUD CONTINUES TO BE AN URGENT PRIORITY FOR COMPANIES, ACCENTURE REPORT FINDS', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--WHILE INVESTMENTS IN CLOUD MIGRATIONS HAVE SURGED, ORGANIZATIONS NOW MUST SHIFT THEIR FOCUS TO AN ONGOING JOURNEY IN ORDER TO ACHIEVE EXPECTED OUTCOMES AT HIGHER RATES, ACCORDING TO NEW RESEARCH FROM ACCENTURE (NYSE: ACN).'}{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2023-01-10 07:59:00', 'title': 'ACCENTURE LIFE INSURANCE & ANNUITY PLATFORM ACHIEVES “LUMINARY” STATUS AND WINS XCELENT AWARD', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ACCENTURE (NYSE: ACN) HAS RECEIVED THE XCELENT ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY 2022 AWARD FOR ITS NEW BUSINESS AND UNDERWRITING SOLUTION FROM RESEARCH AND ADVISORY FIRM CELENT.'}{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2023-01-10 03:10:00', 'title': 'ACCENTURE TO ACQUIRE SKS GROUP, STRENGTHENING ITS SAP® AND REGULATORY CAPABILITIES FOR BANKING CLIENTS IN GERMANY, AUSTRIA AND SWITZERLAND', 'text': 'HOCHHEIM, GERMANY--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ACCENTURE (NYSE: ACN) HAS AGREED TO ACQUIRE SKS GROUP, A CONSULTING FIRM THAT HELPS BANKS ACROSS GERMANY, AUSTRIA AND SWITZERLAND MODERNIZE THEIR TECHNOLOGY INFRASTRUCTURE AND ADDRESS REGULATORY REQUIREMENTS USING SAP S/4HANA® SOLUTIONS. TERMS OF THE TRANSACTION WERE NOT DISCLOSED.'}